    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.01_reader_onboarding.sections.01_what_the_encyclopedia_is.concrete_anchor_6#mittensoutgoingyonedaprofile" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_01_reader_onboarding_sections_01_what_the_encyclopedia_is_concrete_anchor_6#mittensoutgoingyonedaprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensOutgoingYonedaProfile is the outgoing Yoneda profile of Mittens: covariant functor X -> Hom(Mittens, X). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Y^out_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
